        "sunni": "Ṣaḥīḥ Muslim (Ḥadīth al-Thaqalayn) · Sunan al-Tirmidhī · Musnad Aḥmad · al-Ḥākim, al-Mustadrak",
        "shia": "al-Kulaynī, al-Kāfī · al-Mufīd, al-Irshād · Biḥār al-Anwār (al-Majlisī) · with the Sunni isnāds above"
